{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1218,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1778530dd5008f6dba168955",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的芭蕾舞是爸爸教的。\r\n以前冬天的时候，\r\n他常常让我练习「胡桃夹子」呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab932ef5bdb0fe809feab7ea813ea45d5136502cb8d3f77cfc151304105d085d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e3a76730cfa0791d0e660e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次休假的时候好像是好天气呢。\r\n干脆来洗我的塔酱好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7f4d400142105940525f83a251df6e26743b197eb050e1051ae980884ff2f1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c475efeeb3291e0f6ba0ef40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和妈妈什么都能聊哦♪\r\n我们之间就像朋友一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab863566fecc84dc229370be0d792d33e6f8f2ee667fb17be4a1e39a62ecbea9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef541d3ec5453fa9b9f3a2da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小特吃饭时看起来很幸福的模样，\r\n真的很卡哇伊呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0865d0b6940e9aabaf6ab18ce5b5d4793da6c3bf8314303cbae4454ff44c5393",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edb0c99b11348ea4213476f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要释放压力的时候，\r\n就一定要去兜风呢！\r\n如何？今晚有空吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b21a2670417d9935dffc5e6a25cdba634435da0e17717b979b7c7acff663c4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95ad9f345fba3fede6d19295",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小赤骥她真的是个很独立的人。\r\n……也因为这样，\r\n我总是忍不住想要对她好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48b00bfe3612ecb94bd516c22d38bd71d6f859896c4330b1760dcb6a8a9e7019",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2184466ec4c1f571f61d0222",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊──！\r\n我梦到自己在舞厅热舞呢～♪\r\n今天状态非常棒哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ca3f4457bc69f8c7257307ed741bdffaceaa61d26b27b0ac76273f821c60fd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ec8be031d8cb36d343c16eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗨☆训练员君，\r\n你去过车站附近新开的喫茶店了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "518b933cfa55ffa4c03bcf078ee06ab708c10089d9c382cd83bbd15c17623a60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f4fe4bf2faf5a4bb8689761",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想不想看看晚上的海？\r\n今晚的风感觉特别舒服呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcc621351eeaf73faf4f13f3debe40b82963dfafdd189110f92b5f0e767d47bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7767ceb2877745a8fa723b10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花飞舞的景色很棒吧？\r\n花瓣闪闪发亮得很漂亮。\r\n在底下热舞感觉应该会很棒♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e54474253c5c9a6a83538cc3a154f126c5e3ec0da06e71c3380d47ab369fd46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5afe7c2e5ee284c181512a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去游泳池吗？还是海边？\r\n啊──还是我们干脆两种都去吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7934d46e6a59315c14a9b4d7c95156d4aeabe82cf832a7c6722e3b05eb941d46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6c868248f3e7f6fc8f32044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家里的佣人好像说过，\r\n这个时期的海里会有水母出没，\r\n所以不可以去海里玩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "039a091147f9bb54dfa3f7f3f027e729084e02709a4646b65aeca74a85d4b432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeac1aac78ec892fda778eeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……你有兴趣尝试冬泳吗？\r\n哎呀，是想叫我别闹了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c929661092542e0f05b4295aaab769e9e95a818aad02905a0529e3d0499bc35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8ed80b9ae99ee91f7e1acec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，重点是这个心型太阳眼镜。\r\n橘黄色的很卡哇伊吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "51970be82b4363519e3fa9ad8cf2bb0471f3b33b6aad0bb5fcf722ad008bcf4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d2e58a038bae006be929b7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还去做了指甲哦～\r\n这是叫做凝胶美甲吧？\r\n是可爱的后辈推荐我去的呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f02fd5fe7a6f50b7207711f282ce837b16cfb2e757a9045f30a0f22112d94916",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:215b639306142b54d701e253",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗨☆训练员，\r\n你去过车站附近新开的喫茶店了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3df1f9768524e6b9e0658013aae77c6d7c04c0439b3bb985725f27ea96b883d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebaccab0de013b18f031f734",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不只是观众们，我也希望\r\n演唱会能让包含训练员\r\n和我自己在内的所有人都开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e8a2e41122e4931ac626dd424de4705c8d4428e5179021b43d5600dc63c5c61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "91105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e8b24536c3538abd111ab19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我随时都是准备好的状态哦♪\r\n那要先从什么开始做起呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a79bf97822b39caf42de3f98ab207a133666e9a3e4f580d25af07cfe8980b87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afee127bf694b6b64c1626ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "かっ飛ばすわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96df98365dc133a91a099cfc1b3e18085c0ee6dced36d26d3994349882d48f9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72d99be72bebcb7f6ae184a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～！\r\n我要尽情地加速了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccdee0feb015a42d2e7837781c6a6073d2aa8f8bef503df2a4cda765bc6a6105",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dab35fa2c16035cc5b1ddeab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就尽情地\r\n去跑一下吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "20c9a8d3731700f87bc29fc5e1d9219c3be1e73f99da0f7bea5d04132bca6a34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47722ba01c0494011330f0ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "反正都要训练，\r\n就想让训练时间变得很愉快嘛。\r\n呵呵，麻烦你咯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3afe9defedda68901c8ca332ee117ab58db0312edd87e992b4879f002c96a91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91a9954d7d6464ef07e2f8ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是你为我编排的训练项目，\r\n我全都可以。\r\n因为我每次都跑得很开心嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d97a54f82ba0e43b3d9da634fdabd08cee49788aac1e7b242f8aed1360d3471",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0feb5064fb45e288fe24e5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是你为我编排的训练项目，\r\n我全都可以。\r\n因为我每次都跑得很开心嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d97a54f82ba0e43b3d9da634fdabd08cee49788aac1e7b242f8aed1360d3471",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba9cb641518bffa132bf656",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是正式比赛还是训练，\r\n要做的事都一样。\r\n我会让你看见我尽情享受的模样♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "edd78ac85b625e847d5afc04b1a91aba7305e1f7fe3ca28c60a241e563f02462",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c72536950ca8a8fad72a2247",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是正式比赛还是训练，\r\n要做的事都一样。\r\n我会让你看见我尽情享受的模样♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "edd78ac85b625e847d5afc04b1a91aba7305e1f7fe3ca28c60a241e563f02462",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70dde35d7cf9f30f7b3c2a7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果我是超跑的话，\r\n那你就是车手了。为了跑出最高速，\r\n就麻烦你为我编排训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d0c520465fcafa147038df64fbc016b82dbc0993d1aaed74d2efb20775aef0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e14098e999c088be6b7ebb2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果我是超跑的话，\r\n那你就是车手了。为了跑出最高速，\r\n就麻烦你为我编排训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d0c520465fcafa147038df64fbc016b82dbc0993d1aaed74d2efb20775aef0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8db4dbe900dee75aee99f7d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "油门全开，我要全速奔跑了！\r\n无论是什么样的训练项目都是小意思！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00739e5289e30dfe221cfdc3c9e3becbd5b73ca5fe9c48308f0aa2c734ec5753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3d6e6ac7a0671206d563886",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的干劲十足♪\r\n全都包在我身上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17f1e58046d784cdb7aab23ac4ae12f9c79578ff3f51bded98fe30ac8b9c68a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:378219c8d0fe62fc96f857c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天一定要全力以赴♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "da85598bb578c49b384aeb44ebba595619a44b9d979edd1fd4c7f57bd6379575",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f15fe73a03faca11a7445584",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天就算做比较严苛的训练，\r\n我也完全没问题哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42734b5b3c40160b4f602d4dd69a467b61581b248bb4be37457c66d85559a9c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcc1765ea587914d4727ad3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我都准备好了──！\r\n再来就看训练员打算怎么样咯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a00abaf91e9db70b75ff2e4db30a4a6fbe9a2a943df0175eb558ea78753c0ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33c8676c9de28105ef0bf6c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我必须成为一个，\r\n大家都想追逐的目标才行呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fba62c317bb967d818aeb628c042f989891a2ae654903192ca62ec7e042610a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8472f30978e5f65abd76b36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要试着，\r\n朝只有我们能到达的目标迈进？",
      "source_fingerprint": "36015500204d25abead0dd8edcf0d1c86c465acd6dd09f5881b126822cd25570",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e47b92b6df3fece27f04695",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道训练员君你一定\r\n可以带我达成了不起的成就。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62f0b89e7d5b5636415d0ae97edef2529e7c4c7d10a468c73b46c9c743a99dd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:311ce07d23fa39394b5e8db7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我都准备好了──！\r\n再来就看训练员打算怎么样咯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a00abaf91e9db70b75ff2e4db30a4a6fbe9a2a943df0175eb558ea78753c0ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d478fd7e7ace0b45b76d5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道训练员你一定\r\n可以带我达成了不起的成就。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3144c0c6d9d7c3dc3c2b1de236a1647b5a7ad9999320b0ae025634ec3ba68bfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "92024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e0c72bfd6acf6fd406f179e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情超好的！\r\n这都是因为有你在我身旁哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1d53f14ce52f33b560f2566d4267b0abd6c59ae8a8b0c11230e4d1610bf85d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a09011ddf91181a2753a630",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心情超好的！\r\n这都是因为有你在我身旁哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1d53f14ce52f33b560f2566d4267b0abd6c59ae8a8b0c11230e4d1610bf85d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c76d4b9a536c73632cea043",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有达到你对我的期许吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c64eddf1d75cbb5f39f883de151db87e1a1e73213dd0825308aa6702d79f6078",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "93002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa85f60e05306aaacc9d501d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有达到你对我的期许吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c64eddf1d75cbb5f39f883de151db87e1a1e73213dd0825308aa6702d79f6078",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "93003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e995d54baf0ad94dac2987da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，没有训练员君的话，\r\n我是绝对走不到今天的。\r\n……谢谢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "63f910099a93c2498c75fd7b0dd2d415d2d462c516af8c2cee13d18234154fbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80b2202ca3bf8576dfa5d28d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为你，我才能有今天……\r\n我感激涕零得唏哩哗啦！说笑的啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "22c29396ec416397e04ced2038afb85975935b03e28c4116cd54e08e19900671",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a290f8bd9ab7d44f9d5cc6ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，没有训练员的话，\r\n我是绝对走不到今天的。\r\n……谢谢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d1d267b05229b8347668a81a95c664b39f2a714fbb0ace3e9c248c919f0d14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "93006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a89a78a9d2e52a924de003a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯，感觉很好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de266fa17f2bc5dff237e9a71c93e3c17e78857f3dd55586bdb18e0504a14824",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ee6297c3103f2c79afa2962",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还可以更快哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8a2ec6a86e98edf4168a648333b29e8bc4cd595a5749f237cc1001219114f86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98d0fe93e5b0914b8901fb40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗨～我是丸善斯基哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdd1f1f217414d34a3b83ae1327dc5d066b344eb67f6b25c0ace5b537ef261c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0501bd9c9fc8052fa65893a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你能跟得上\r\n我超乎常理的速度吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4d4486a645298eccbf02afb8470dae5e03780b117d054503b69be3f322de7d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c23de4bc5517b72fdc6c869",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有可靠姐姐的感觉吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "849a1f99f044fef49f72da08e0776e9fd64393be9fc0ef3dc8e2e481d2e6eceb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27f3606a646cbc3fd69e15d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还会继续支持大家的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e2b07074a60b4bb367954d0d345b7830a73f4297f01599c0b0e5a7f25de5320",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b143353d5ff1cb34a764cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我成功啦宝贝♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "29cc7c3efc48cac95e1323de2f1162688a25ffd98174587f8b5919ca101d246e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:542d4e24f60b376eeaa8c67b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "继续上咯！咻咻──♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "28726d16903657496204c8b63535fb08fda334df27de61455d745cd1ea59170b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb9f069a1bba01d5f27e494c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然都夏天了嘛！\r\n就要好好地狂热一番呀♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fea4f68adf63e7d0046ee546aebb617cd2825c7c265447cdb8a05fd79dd7dcc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdf67989a176b5e9343116e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗨！我是大家的前辈──丸善斯基♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0da2aff35446985acf72b1af5c832d74056baab43fdd8373789e6067fc77fd03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cbc14d30705b79f7a5bcc47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f0665e0a69c08888c3252e4588492414e62eb2a101e0b2a5a81f3189d824bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fbc34a50d4b274cf73ac83b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然让你看了不少我没用的样子，\r\n但今后我会比谁都更加耀眼的。\r\n这也是为了让你看到「奇迹」嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e14b81c35316cf6b1b4ceb995b15902294cabab87959cc885124aebb83a7de45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b79eda6f9a324ca287cb43c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b0ea50770e74cc57d8f86c94661e324efb2d5121688e3ebb0854357aea8420",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:641e32e13274bc2eec59c03a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d7f5a92499a52f82117a02e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我希望和你成为互相扶持的好伙伴。\r\n……所以，\r\n我希望你也能信任、依赖我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a92d82b79e8355a01b78c80daa0a11d8f6f9476c2614be9f2baaa05368af35d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b9ab49b91f7ac293e45ce8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想让人看见「奇迹」的我，\r\n和让我看见「希望」的人……\r\n我说的就是你哦，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b00d4a8540a2e070b8ce16b5e531d8cc6bd329c2134bd52c2d1433165f9d3f98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a2ecc432c30530995dede25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗨，新年快乐！\r\n为了应景，来变出个门松好了……\r\n算了，这实在是太难了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c30b7fb7cf89f2161f422c421dbbaf6c4365b44dfb6e19d86485ff32c79b13c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b73ec3c21e1078379fb55855",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员喜欢吃巧克力吗？\r\n那你看一下包包里面。\r\n呵呵，这是我给你的小惊喜♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6962bae36ee222c33ae859be7d05e7df9be1bdbae200ef8793a6f833cce7a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:638b90f83c7efe9d39160b96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个……是我为你准备的。\r\n哈哈，用开玩笑的语气说都没事，\r\n正经地说就觉得……很害羞呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0760da723b0c3f510ae55f8766caa795e872468a8a00dc984c096fcbd7c392b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:397875bdf760e49893096c9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是我的话，即使没有银河，\r\n我也会去见织女的。\r\n为了向夜空送上我的「奇迹」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6af220e24063b225117b2d953bf77d2065601c49221ca7e5c9c68b8d9618ca2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:941a86ee63c69dcc47aaf060",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋！呵呵。\r\n那么，我该为训练员准备\r\n怎样的惊喜好呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b6c5bb42d9c9630016b963775e26cad0a4bd93fe71435d145ef806bc509042a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0c32dc83f8b647121b13f08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你小时候相信圣诞老人的存在吗？\r\n我现在都还是相信哦。\r\n因为这样比较有趣嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e923eb1450760e7527df2035dd448fa8575500c4a89c9215eecd20c0c6337309",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:774b52bdb338902f0f318b6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐！\r\n如果你有空的话，\r\n请务必让我带你一起过圣诞节哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d11cda2796651406da133516e273fa69f4adec12eab63cfd643b293b0cca072",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e3071724f68b090ab69247a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们赢了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2683e66cffb291becf9fcf9338654b262ec1dc080788adf243d2d90ddf838de8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9de5b7e9ae6fbb89fe6544e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍也有大扫除的时候，当中还有\r\n想跑掉不帮忙的人呢，呵呵。\r\n那时候就是快乐的追逐战时间了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc7abbe0bee2ee1a7a0b7c6324460fa8f46aa4d14e08954bc6d0fe1d9db7e8c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa59c30bd4105a476ff0c8af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\r\n难得的日子，\r\n我希望带给你最棒的回忆当作礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eb7e1cd6753b108d04d97cff0bf33cf1dedc515905f018202a9c7735094e1e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d776c662d1a993a4bdcbdce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想到这是纪念你出生的日子，\r\n我就会自然地露出笑容……\r\n生日快乐，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40b9d4d21287fc40a67a626fdae3b1a512c33f179940f3e13f1efe016f12b220",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17f7b8c2190aaab63ad13e08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能够用超越笑容的东西，\r\n来回馈送礼物的大家，\r\n我还要更努力精进自己才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f42cfca235e420951f4a52153ec099834a51b7bb5d6e1bf9ae4dd41ac5697721",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d25a01fd179ff2ea636e8ad8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有你帮我过生日，\r\n我真是幸福的人。\r\n谢谢你，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de44273f9964367275464977775b266b4991a432fc063832f81a301d678c05a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca3bee8c7d120537e9d9f577",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新的公告呢。\r\n趁忘记之前，\r\n还是先确认一下比较好吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dea98088378791d48524f3f2c3007e25a29180fc61c48981da5f05c91d6deaff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18749d1457530d3ec21e44b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了哦。\r\n呵呵，能因为这样看见你的笑容吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "45b105c4bf73c3a7f8540d8e90fa52ac5cd06b25c8d1341f7427007a0e5e1403",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:190c5061fdf306dbf72feffe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成任务了，恭喜你！\r\n付出总是有回报的。\r\n也不枉费你这么努力了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c82b487cd707df38de57d418182e349390616689658521dbafc1c1b8d5198ed0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25a509330497587200d169c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎正在准备活动呢。\r\n既然自称是表演家，\r\n就没有理由不参加！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfc641a65c0eac93f0f588c6852305310cc9844d8c76ceeedbe13b075c0e7aec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef8852211ca6017ea43f8282",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了呢。\r\n我们一起去好好享受吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "911bc18fecabe549d4e9c47d65156552cd05a5f631430385c53cd23c21c5d2a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b3798db1469967d8bb88aaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真没面子……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eab88256532f9920f77cc322d169b5f5cd48296c08d01cb0748527537a80527",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1005",
        "1002"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
